"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Uncover the dark side of the Knights of the True Cross and the mystery of the \"Blue Night\"!\n\nBrothers Rin and Yukio head to Lake Towada in Aomori to search for Shura, who had suddenly disappeared. There, they find Shura’s birthplace – the place where Shiro became her guardian. As their search continues, Rin and Yukio discover the fate that awaits Shura.\n\nMeanwhile, Lightning, one of the Arch Knights, arrives at the Japan Branch of the Knights of the True Cross and begins his investigation into the Illuminati. Lightning deduces that everything began on the “Blue Night,” as he gradually steps into the dark side of the Knights of the True Cross….\n\n(Source: Aniplex USA)"},"tags":[{"name":"Twins","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Exorcism","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Religion","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Youkai","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Blue Exorcist -Beyond the Snow Saga-","english":"Blue Exorcist -Beyond the Snow Saga-","native":"青の祓魔師 雪ノ果篇","romaji":"Ao no Exorcist: Yuki no Hate-hen","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"青之驱魔师 雪之尽头篇"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Blue Exorcist: Beyond the Snow Saga"}]},"trailer":{"id":"idfqKTtEmF4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/idfqKTtEmF4/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}